Pre-quest conversion, while it may be fun, may risk imbalance.  If one
can perform a pre-quest alignment conversion, then there is no longer
any impediment (other than lack of altars) to an early wish and use of
a cross-class artifact.  For example, a low-level elven priest could
wish for the Eye, or an early knight could wish for the Orb of Fate.
With the risk of loss of game, one can not use their cross-class cross-
alignment blessed fixed greased +2 Tsurugi of Muramasa (for example)
until they've finished the quest, and by then the power of an artifact
is not so imbalanced.

